From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mio <mio@mio19.uk>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 08:07:14 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] meshcore: select the Raumata operating mode and radio profile

The MeshCore tab can switch between mainly Meshtastic, mainly MeshCore, and both protocols on either family's physical configuration.

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>

diff --git a/feature/meshcore/README.md b/feature/meshcore/README.md
index 9b04eaed7f510faffac6209bd29a09afa57e2966..9711a18b66cdb49bd74db4304dbd8b12fba59402 100644
--- a/feature/meshcore/README.md
+++ b/feature/meshcore/README.md
@@ -40,8 +40,10 @@ uses the app's existing Bluetooth permissions.
 ## Usage
 
 Select the **MeshCore** destination in the app shell, choose USB or Bluetooth,
-scan, and connect. The screen shows channels and contacts; tapping one opens a
-chat pane with a message composer.
+scan, and connect. The screen shows the operating mode (mainly Meshtastic,
+mainly MeshCore, or both protocols on a Meshtastic or MeshCore physical
+profile), the presets that mode allows, then channels and contacts. Tapping a
+channel or contact opens a chat pane with a message composer.
 
 ## Limitations
 
